  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/08/IMG_4903.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21.3333px;\">72 fotos de la tercera y &uacute;ltima jornada de la sexta edici&oacute;n del Onda Summer Contest, que se ha celebrado de viernes a domingo&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21.3333px;\">en el Skate Park municipal de la calle Segorbe, junto al parque comarcal de bomberos y el Centro de Emergencias.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondasummercontes16diumenge/img_4824.jpg\" alt=\"img_4824\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondasummercontes16diumenge/img_4825.jpg\" alt=\"img_4825\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondasummercontes16diumenge/img_4826.jpg\" alt=\"img_4826\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondasummercontes16diumenge/img_4827.jpg\" alt=\"img_4827\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondasummercontes16diumenge/img_4828.jpg\" alt=\"img_4828\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondasummercontes16diumenge/img_4829.jpg\" alt=\"img_4829\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondasummercontes16diumenge/img_4830.jpg\" alt=\"img_4830\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondasummercontes16diumenge/img_4832.jpg\" alt=\"img_4832\" style=\"max-wid